WEBVTT

00:08:57.694 --> 00:09:01.054
Who are these guys? What are they learning?

00:09:01.054 --> 00:09:02.770
What are they failing to learn?

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:04.920
Are they absorbing the story that

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:09.447
a male hero's job is to defeat the villain with violence

00:09:09.447 --> 00:09:11.980
and then collect the reward, which is a woman

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:17.028
who has no friends and doesn't speak?

00:09:17.028 --> 00:09:22.233
Are we soaking up that story?

00:09:22.233 --> 00:09:24.579
You know,

00:09:24.579 --> 00:09:27.346
as a parent with the privilege

00:09:27.346 --> 00:09:29.990
of raising a daughter

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:32.859
like all of you who are doing the same thing,